WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:02.094
Welcome to One Mission.

2
00:00:02.094 --> 00:00:06.019
The Floor brings your account, gold
context, and AI tools together.

3
00:00:07.068 --> 00:00:10.303
Tap Talk to Atlas to speak, or Type a
question.

4
00:00:10.323 --> 00:00:12.698
Ask, “What’s happening with gold?”

5
00:00:12.698 --> 00:00:16.382
Your conversation and generated signals
stay right here in the app.

6
00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:21.123
OM AI Plays looks for setups in your
chosen market.

7
00:00:21.143 --> 00:00:23.393
GENX focuses on gold.

8
00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:25.298
Pulse scans markets.

9
00:00:25.318 --> 00:00:29.293
Gold Command Center is Atlas’s
dedicated gold workspace;

10
00:00:29.293 --> 00:00:31.886
the Atlas tab opens your in-app
assistant.

11
00:00:32.931 --> 00:00:34.431
Choose a market and style,

12
00:00:34.431 --> 00:00:37.721
check the displayed cost, and tap
Generate play.

13
00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:42.159
For GENX, pick Quick, Intraday, or
Swing, then Analyze gold.

14
00:00:43.157 --> 00:00:47.517
Review the entry, stop, targets, and
timeframe breakdown.

15
00:00:47.537 --> 00:00:49.842
Tap Explain this signal for help.

16
00:00:49.862 --> 00:00:53.801
Read any waiting or unconfirmed label
before deciding what to do.

17
00:00:54.852 --> 00:00:57.202
In FLOW, tap Connect account.

18
00:00:57.202 --> 00:00:59.377
Choose Demo or Live, then enter

19
00:00:59.377 --> 00:01:02.932
your broker’s Server and TradeLocker
email and password.

20
00:01:02.952 --> 00:01:05.152
New accounts start with Trading on.

21
00:01:05.152 --> 00:01:07.552
Open Manage accounts to check Trading,

22
00:01:07.552 --> 00:01:11.932
Follow every GENX signal, risk, and
Auto-run FLOW.

23
00:01:11.952 --> 00:01:15.169
Enabled automation can place trades
without another prompt.

24
00:01:16.238 --> 00:01:20.813
For a manual trade, open Execute BUY or
SELL on the signal.

25
00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:24.148
Review the receiving accounts, risk,
and size.

26
00:01:24.148 --> 00:01:26.653
These tickets place at the current
price.

27
00:01:26.673 --> 00:01:30.495
Tap Execute, then the final
confirmation only when you’re ready.

28
00:01:31.498 --> 00:01:35.098
Back on The Floor, Active trades shows
running pips.

29
00:01:35.098 --> 00:01:39.628
Take partial, Breakeven, and Close
trade each open a review.

30
00:01:39.648 --> 00:01:41.898
Winning streaks separate FLOW on your
selected

31
00:01:41.898 --> 00:01:44.305
account from GENX community calls.

32
00:01:45.364 --> 00:01:47.564
AI helps you understand setups.

33
00:01:47.564 --> 00:01:49.289
Results aren’t guaranteed.

34
00:01:49.289 --> 00:01:50.829
Start by asking Atlas.
